# Guide updates bump editorial date

When shipping a **substantial** guide/article change (rewritten intros, new or replaced film notes, group copy, film list changes), update `updatedAt` in `lib/guides/public-guide-links.mjs` for that guide’s slug to today’s date (`YYYY-MM-DD`).

`Updated` on the page and `dateModified` SEO come from that field — not from git.

Do **not** bump for typo-only, styling-only, or unrelated infra fixes.

Also update any test that asserts that guide’s `updatedAt` (e.g. `lib/guides/resolve-guide-films.test.mjs`).

Example: rewriting Flow film notes without changing `updatedAt` left the byline on the old date.
